        <section class="row arts no-gutters">
            <div class="contentWidth3 no-gutters">
                <div class="col-12">
                    <div class=" inner-box">
                        <h2>Blueprint for Your Future</h2>
                        <p class="p1">Get hands-on CNC Machining training and expert guidance to set yourself up for success. With 44,000 job openings annually and 7% job growth by 2030, this high-demand field offers secure and rewarding career opportunities.</p>
<hr />
<p class="p1"><strong>Get experience in our state-of-the-art CNC lab, learning to create precision parts with cutting-edge equipment.</strong></p>
                        
                            			                                            			            <a class=" btn-primary btn-block" href="programs/degrees/manufacturing-trades-transportation/cnc-machining-technology" target="_parent" type="submit">Explore CNC</a>
    			                    			                             
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div aria-hidden="true" class="factoid d-none d-md-block" role="none">
                  <span class="factNum">1</span>
                  <span class="factTxt">Year Diploma</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            
        </section>
        
            <style>
            
                section.blockquote-bg {
                    background-image: url(_files/img/homepage/kirkwood-homepage-student-testimonial-2024-stock.jpg);

                }
        </style>
                
                
        <section class="row blockquote-bg  no-gutters">
            <div class="contentWidth3">
                <div class=" d-flex flex-row-reverse">
                    <div class="quote-box">
                        <blockquote>
                            <p class="quote-text2">My instructors are former law enforcement officers with real-world experience. Touring the Linn County Courthouse made it clear how everything connects to what we learn in class"</p>
                            <div class="row no-gutters">
                                <div class="col-4 col-sm-3 block-img"><img alt="Malayna Arp" src="_files/img/testimonials/kirkwood-student-malayna-arp-2023.jpg" /></div>
                                <div class="col-5 txtWhite test-bio">
                                    <span>Malayna Arp</span>
                                    <span>Walker, Iowa | Criminal Justice Program</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="row no-gutters">
                              <div class="col-12"> <hr />
                              </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="row no-gutters">
                                <div class="col-12 quote-helper">
                                    <strong>From the Classroom to the Courthouse</strong><br />
                                    <p class="p1">Start your career right after graduation, or explore our Liberal Arts degree if you're planning to transfer to a 4-year college or university.</p>
                                </div>
            
                            </div>
                        </blockquote>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div aria-hidden="true" class="factoid d-none d-md-block" role="none">
                    <span class="factNum">AAS</span>
                    <span class="factTxt">Associate of Applied Science degree</span>
                </div>
            </div>
          
        </section>
    
  





 


 
 

 
 
 



